    {
      "text": "strong to be broken by weak, D&C 1:19. humble to be made strong, D&C 1:28. Saints not to purchase wine or strong drink, D&C 27:3. be ye strong from henceforth, D&C 38:15. he who is weak shall be made strong, D&C 50:16. he who trembles under the Lord’s power shall be made strong, D&C 52:17. faithful shall be made strong, D&C 66:8. he who is strong in the Spirit shall take him who is weak, D&C 84:106. the Lord will send one mighty and strong, D&C 85:7. strong drinks are not for belly, D&C 89:7. thy confidence shall wax strong, D&C 121:45. little one shall become strong nation, D&C 133:58.",
